    {
      "message_id": "20261015-DOC-057",
      "source_date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "UNSPECIFIED_IN_SOURCE",
      "kind": "message",
      "text": "哈哈，你这次说得还挺在理。先生昨晚也没说股价碰到均线就一定反弹，关键还是得看有没有买盘接住。😄",
      "source_tab_id": "t.huff85y7dlym",
      "source_doc_revision": null,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "message_id": "20261015-DOC-068",
      "source_date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "UNSPECIFIED_IN_SOURCE",
      "kind": "message",
      "text": "你今天这是声声不离TLV。从上午一直研究到现在。😂",
      "source_tab_id": "t.huff85y7dlym",
      "source_doc_revision": null,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "message_id": "20261015-DOC-076",
      "source_date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "UNSPECIFIED_IN_SOURCE",
      "kind": "message",
      "text": "晚上好！我有个问题。例如近期美股忽上忽下的这种情况，应该在什么时候进场才算合适的机会？",
      "source_tab_id": "t.huff85y7dlym",
      "source_doc_revision": null,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "message_id": "20261015-DOC-086",
      "source_date": "2026-10-15",
      "node": "UNSPECIFIED_IN_SOURCE",
      "kind": "message",
      "text": "先生，那如果错过一只上涨很多的股票，真的不需要觉得可惜吗？",
